  DialogueSnippets:
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Dad was always supportive of me, except for that day, he even scolded me
  - SpeakerName: Young Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19cb878ae217df648ba82e0116391c43, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Maybe because he is a human being, sometimes he has good days, and sometimes
      he has bad days. Like when you slipped like an idiot twice
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: You little shit
  - SpeakerName: Narrator
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: '"Mina sees there are bills of due to payments"'
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: I am so stupid. He just had a lot on his plate. How stupid of you.
  - SpeakerName: Young Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19cb878ae217df648ba82e0116391c43, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: ME!! I am just a 5-year-old girl, how would I know what this weird tax
      person wants money for????
